ados de membresía que validan la afiliación de los ingenieros. Este servicio garantiza que nuestros afiliados cuenten con el respaldo institucional necesario para ejercer su profesión y acceder a beneficios exclusivos.</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/advanced-heading --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block_id\":\"0c412db5\",\"directionDesktop\":\"row\",\"alignItemsTablet\":\"center\",\"alignItemsMobile\":\"center\",\"backgroundType\":\"color\",\"backgroundColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-4)\",\"topPaddingDesktop\":100,\"bottomPaddingDesktop\":100,\"leftPaddingDesktop\":40,\"rightPaddingDesktop\":40,\"topPaddingTablet\":80,\"bottomPaddingTablet\":80,\"leftPaddingTablet\":32,\"rightPaddingTablet\":32,\"topPaddingMobile\":64,\"bottomPaddingMobile\":64,\"leftPaddingMobile\":24,\"rightPaddingMobile\":24,\"paddingLink\":false,\"topMarginDesktop\":0,\"bottomMarginDesktop\":0,\"leftMarginDesktop\":0,\"rightMarginDesktop\":0,\"topMarginTablet\":0,\"bottomMarginTablet\":0,\"leftMarginTablet\":0,\"rightMarginTablet\":0,\"marginLink\":false,\"variationSelected\":true,\"rowGapMobile\":32,\"columnGapDesktop\":80,\"columnGapTablet\":60,\"isBlockRootParent\":true,\"childrenWidthDesktop\":\"equal\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-0c412db5 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\"><!-- wp:uagb/advanced-heading {\"block_id\":\"1df7c5de\",\"classMigrate\":true,\"headingDescToggle\":true,\"headingColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-2)\",\"subHeadingColor\":\"\",\"separatorColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-0)\",\"seperatorStyle\":\"solid\",\"seperatorPosition\":\"above-heading\",\"separatorWidth\":50,\"separatorWidthType\":\"px\",\"headSpace\":16,\"subHeadSpace\":0,\"separatorSpace\":10} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-1df7c5de\"><div class=\"uagb-separator\"></div><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Legalización de Documentos</h2><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Brindamos asistencia en la legalización de documentos, incluyendo visados de planos y otros trámites técnicos. Nuestro equipo garantiza el cumplimiento de las normativas y requisitos establecidos para facilitar a los socios sus gestiones profesionales.</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/advanced-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block_id\":\"c0e43976\",\"widthDesktop\":50,\"minHeightDesktop\":440,\"minHeightTablet\":300,\"minHeightMobile\":300,\"alignItemsTablet\":\"center\",\"alignItemsMobile\":\"flex-start\",\"justifyContentTablet\":\"center\",\"justifyContentMobile\":\"flex-start\",\"backgroundType\":\"image\",\"backgroundImageDesktop\":{\"id\":1121,\"title\":\"488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1\",\"filename\":\"488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1-scaled.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://siblpz.org.bo/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1-scaled.jpg\",\"link\":\"https://siblpz.org.bo/488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1/\",\"alt\":\"488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1\",\"author\":\"0\",\"description\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"name\":\"488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1\",\"status\":\"inherit\",\"uploadedTo\":0,\"date\":1769449214000,\"modified\":1769449214000,\"menuOrder\":0,\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"type\":\"image\",\"subtype\":\"jpeg\",\"icon\":\"https://siblpz.org.bo/wp-includes/images/media/default.svg\",\"dateFormatted\":\"26 enero, 2026\",\"nonces\":{\"update\":false,\"delete\":false,\"edit\":false},\"editLink\":false,\"meta\":false,\"authorName\":\"(sin autor)\",\"filesizeInBytes\":396329,\"filesizeHumanReadable\":\"387 KB\",\"context\":\"\",\"originalImageURL\":\"https://siblpz.org.bo/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1.jpg\",\"originalImageName\":\"488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1.jpg\",\"height\":964,\"width\":2560,\"orientation\":\"landscape\",\"sizes\":{\"thumbnail\":{\"