b-block-5ca96e19\"><div class=\"uagb-separator\"></div><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Consultas Técnicas</h2><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Ofrecemos un servicio de consultas técnicas y éticas donde nuestros socios pueden obtener asesoría sobre normativas, mejores prácticas y resolver dudas relacionadas con su ejercicio profesional. Este apoyo es fundamental para mantener un estándar ético en la profesión.</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/advanced-heading --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block_id\":\"ffb294d0\",\"directionDesktop\":\"row\",\"alignItemsTablet\":\"center\",\"alignItemsMobile\":\"center\",\"backgroundType\":\"color\",\"backgroundColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-4)\",\"topPaddingDesktop\":100,\"bottomPaddingDesktop\":100,\"leftPaddingDesktop\":40,\"rightPaddingDesktop\":40,\"topPaddingTablet\":80,\"bottomPaddingTablet\":80,\"leftPaddingTablet\":32,\"rightPaddingTablet\":32,\"topPaddingMobile\":64,\"bottomPaddingMobile\":64,\"leftPaddingMobile\":24,\"rightPaddingMobile\":24,\"paddingLink\":false,\"topMarginDesktop\":0,\"bottomMarginDesktop\":0,\"leftMarginDesktop\":0,\"rightMarginDesktop\":0,\"topMarginTablet\":0,\"bottomMarginTablet\":0,\"leftMarginTablet\":0,\"rightMarginTablet\":0,\"marginLink\":false,\"variationSelected\":true,\"rowGapMobile\":32,\"columnGapDesktop\":80,\"columnGapTablet\":60,\"isBlockRootParent\":true,\"childrenWidthDesktop\":\"equal\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ffb294d0 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\"><!-- wp:uagb/advanced-heading {\"block_id\":\"38c491c3\",\"classMigrate\":true,\"headingDescToggle\":true,\"headingColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-2)\",\"subHeadingColor\":\"\",\"separatorColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-0)\",\"seperatorStyle\":\"solid\",\"seperatorPosition\":\"above-heading\",\"separatorWidth\":50,\"separatorWidthType\":\"px\",\"headSpace\":16,\"subHeadSpace\":0,\"separator