ss=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Certificados de Membresía</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Emisión de certificados para validar la afiliación y derecho a representación.</p>\n<div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a href=\"/services\" target=\"_self\" onclick=\"return true;\" class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Leer Más</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-f53abe03\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-fb02528e wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://siblpz.org.bo/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1-scaled.jpg ,https://siblpz.org.bo/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1-scaled.jpg 780w, https://siblpz.org.bo/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1-scaled.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https://siblpz.org.bo/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"488011329-1259762496152818-1596553701287975968-n-1\" class=\"uag-image-1121\" width=\"394\" height=\"480\" title=\"services-02\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-5fde7d97 uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\">\n<div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\">\n<div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\">\n<h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Legalización de Documentos</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Servicios para la legalización de documentos técnicos y profesionales.</p>\n<div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a href=\"/services\" target=\"_self\" onclick=\"return true;\" class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link\" rel=\"noo